# Bank Pod — MailBox & verification

This folder contains the MailBox for the bank pod and example files.

RDF format for MailBox entries: use `owl:sameAs` to link the mailbox entry to the account holder's WebID.

Files:
- `MailBox/.acl` — grants Read/Write to `http://localhost:3000/kielcloak/profile/card#me` and owner control to the bank.
- `MailBox/inbox.ttl` — example entry using `owl:sameAs`.

How to verify (curl / Git Bash):

```bash
BASE='https://solid.valetudo.casa'
TOKEN='<OWNER_TOKEN>'

# List mailbox
curl -I "$BASE/bank/MailBox/"

# GET example (as owner)
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" "$BASE/bank/MailBox/inbox.ttl"

# Negative test: other user should be denied
OTHER='<OTHER_TOKEN>'
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -H "Authorization: Bearer $OTHER" "$BASE/bank/MailBox/inbox.ttl"
```
